  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO-Nestl&#xe9; Alliance - Because Youth Matter - A Pilot in Latin America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of &quot;Because Youth Matter&quot; is to  bring renewed hope and meaning in the lives of young people, harnessing the creative and innovative capacities of young people and open the space for them to voice their perspectives, pursue their aspirations and take action towards a better &quot;normal&quot;. It provides a financial support as well as a capacity-strengthening component that seeks to address the challenges affecting youth employability and entrepreneurship.</narrative>
